        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Today was our 1st time at Karate Sportif and it was amazing! My son really enjoyed his time! Looking forward to going more :) beautiful team and service 🥰",
        "time": 1757257663,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Apira Vigneshwaran",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108923471316840945405/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJpN7xnusOg7S0t1cvjNuJmycPhBvvlUh7QFiE-hgxym-wfckz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I was recently looking for a class for my 3-year-old daughter when I came across this association, and within 24 hours, I had her signed up. From the very first day, the instructors were incredibly welcoming, which made the experience an easy and smooth start for both of us. My daughter absolutely loves it and looks forward to every session. I highly recommend this class to any parent looking for a fun, engaging, and supportive environment for their little one.",
        "time": 1744713767,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Lascano",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102815135408089419562/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVxzCEHWYHVx8fY65UQK1_sYxn5R4X-fjc5ZmZivZ0jDFByyDq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "My 3-year-old son absolutely loves his classes here! All the coaches are incredibly kind, patient, and great with the little ones. He’s learned so much and always looks forward to coming. The registration process was super easy, and the team was quick to answer all of my questions. Booking classes through the app is also really convenient. I’m so happy we found this place—highly recommend it to any parent looking for a fun and supportive environment for their child!",
        "time": 1746720177,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
